 "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gun a Rat</strong>은 친구들과 함께 즐기는 박진감 넘치는 비대칭 멀티플레이어 게임입니다.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>쥐</strong>가 되어 집안을 난장판으로 만들거나... <strong>퇴치사</strong>가 되어 단 한 마리도 남김없이 소탕하세요!<br>다양한 놀라움이 기다리는 여러 맵에서 2명에서 20명까지 참여하는 매치에 뛰어드세요…</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>특별한 음성 채팅...</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>쥐</strong>들은 들킬 걱정 없이 음성 채팅으로 자유롭게 대화할 수 있습니다.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>퇴치사</strong>에게는 대화 내용 대신 쥐의 찌찍거리는 소리만 들리니까요!</p></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/631dfbf1331d4b6f28ab71b62fa426e7.poster.avif?t=1789055885\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/631dfbf1331d4b6f28ab71b62fa426e7.webm?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/631dfbf1331d4b6f28ab71b62fa426e7.mp4?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>쥐로서의 목표:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >제한시간이 끝나기 전에 죽지 않고 물건을 파괴하고 도둑질하여 목표 점수를 달성하세요!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >하지만 조심하세요... 파괴할 때마다 나는 소리가 여러분의 위치를 폭로합니다!</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/785ff52c6008d4641427841beaf273d5.poster.avif?t=1789055885\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/785ff52c6008d4641427841beaf273d5.webm?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/785ff52c6008d4641427841beaf273d5.mp4?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>퇴치사</strong>가 추격해 온다면,<br>가구 속에 빠르게 숨어 시선을 피하세요.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/c24aeb33818dfee17e33f2e12fffb523.poster.avif?t=1789055885\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/c24aeb33818dfee17e33f2e12fffb523.webm?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/c24aeb33818dfee17e33f2e12fffb523.mp4?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>퇴치로서의 목표:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>카메라</strong>를 활용해 쥐들의 이동 경로를 추적하고 숨은 곳을 찾아내세요...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>함정</strong>을 체계적으로 설치해 쥐들의 발을 최대한 묶으세요</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >한 마리도 남김없이 <strong>처치하세요</strong>!</p></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/0aec956a33897aeefeebc9c4f42e2507.poster.avif?t=1789055885\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/0aec956a33897aeefeebc9c4f42e2507.webm?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/0aec956a33897aeefeebc9c4f42e2507.mp4?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >다양한 함정이 준비되어 있어,<br>각 함정마다 <strong>쥐</strong>들에게 색다른 불상사를 선물합니다...</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/53d85907a7ae08ab350d2db6bead0b26.poster.avif?t=1789055885\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/53d85907a7ae08ab350d2db6bead0b26.webm?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/53d85907a7ae08ab350d2db6bead0b26.mp4?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >매치를 계속 플레이하여 <strong>치즈 코인</strong>을 모으고,<br>스킨을 구매해 나만의 쥐를 꾸며보세요!</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/75ed8cf51785b3628cf0fc2842804f8e.poster.avif?t=1789055885\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/75ed8cf51785b3628cf0fc2842804f8e.webm?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/75ed8cf51785b3628cf0fc2842804f8e.mp4?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>자, 여러분은 어느 쪽에 서시겠습니까?</strong></p></p>",
